[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/682055335","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-682055335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":682055335,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY4MjA1NTMzNQ==","user":{"login":"johnmhoran","id":11096678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2Njc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran","html_url":"https://github.com/johnmhoran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-27T16:28:20Z","updated_at":"2020-08-27T16:28:20Z","body":"@swinslow -- I'll tackle this one as well.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/682055335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722076805","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-722076805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":722076805,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMjA3NjgwNQ==","user":{"login":"johnmhoran","id":11096678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2Njc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran","html_url":"https://github.com/johnmhoran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-05T01:59:34Z","updated_at":"2020-11-05T01:59:34Z","body":"From the research I did back in September:\r\n\r\ntldr: The JTidy project is dated, not widely used and not maintained; but there is a GH repo looking for help, and there have been citations to the license in a handful of projects/products in the past few years.\r\n\r\nNo license author/steward listed.\r\n\r\nSimilar to zlib license: compare http://jtidy.sourceforge.net/license.html with https://spdx.org/licenses/Zlib.html \r\n\r\nPer SourceForge pages:\r\n\r\n- Last updated 2012-10-09 (https://sourceforge.net/projects/jtidy/) \r\n- SourceForge link on http://jtidy.sourceforge.net/source-repository.html to \"the online source repository\" leads to a \"not found on this server\" page.  (http://jtidy.svn.sourceforge.net/viewvc/jtidy/) \r\n\r\nThere's a GH repo: https://github.com/jtidy/jtidy \r\n\r\n- \"The new home of JTidy updated to work with HTML5\"\r\n- Includes a link to one of the SourceForge pages.\r\n- Includes a copy of the license (https://github.com/jtidy/jtidy/blob/master/LICENSE.txt) (2004-01-05 is most recent commit)\r\n- README notes that \"JTidy project on SourceForge.net seemed to fall into disrepair years ago and had not been updated for years.  . . .  [¶]  The project is looking for new contributors and project maintainers as it is currently unmaintained.\"\r\n- Latest release: 2019-12-15 (https://github.com/jtidy/jtidy/releases/tag/1.0.2) \r\n\r\nExamples of usage in the wild:\r\n\r\nCisco 2018 (https://www.cisco.com/c/dam/en_us/about/doing_business/open_source/docs/JabberforiPhoneandiPad125v10.pdf) \r\n- \"Open Source Used In Jabber for iPhone and iPad 12.5\", pp. 48 et seq. including copy of license text titled \"HTML Tidy\"\r\n\r\nqm-parcel 1.1.0\r\nCopyright 2020 Cloudera Inc.  All Rights Reserved.\r\nhttps://docs.cloudera.com/documentation/other/shared/licensefiles/cdppc7210/qm-parcel-1-1-0-notice.txt \r\n- component named \"JTidy 4aug2000r7-dev\"\r\n\r\nVeritas Resiliency Platform 3.3 Third-Party Software License Agreements (2018-09-03)\r\nhttps://sort.veritas.com/DocPortal/pdf/133634224-133634229-1 \r\n- includes license notice and text for \"JTidy r938\", a \"Third-Party Program[] . . . licensed under JTidy License.\"\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722076805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722469074","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-722469074","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":722469074,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMjQ2OTA3NA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-05T15:59:56Z","updated_at":"2020-11-05T15:59:56Z","body":"Thanks @johnmhoran, this is very helpful. The reference to \"HTML Tidy\" led me to https://github.com/htacg/tidy-html5/blob/next/README/LICENSE.md, which appears to be sizable (and notable enough to have [its own Wikipedia page](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTML_Tidy), anyway).\r\n\r\nGiven all of the above, and given that it appears to fall within the OSI definition from my read (looks to be [Zlib](https://spdx.org/licenses/Zlib.html)-ish), I'd be in favor of adding it. We can discuss during today's call.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722469074/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722491479","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-722491479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":722491479,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMj