ents{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-05T18:13:53Z","updated_at":"2020-11-05T18:13:53Z","body":"The jtidy sourceforge project does indeed have a presence on the Wayback, with its license found here: https://web.archive.org/web/20180427223718/http://jtidy.sourceforge.net/license.html","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/722550011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/723583318","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-723583318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":723583318,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMzU4MzMxOA==","user":{"login":"tisoft","id":139041,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTA0MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139041?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft","html_url":"https://github.com/tisoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tisoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-08T14:17:36Z","updated_at":"2020-11-08T14:17:36Z","body":"If you consider only the text after COPYRIGHT NOTICE as license, it would probably be better to use \"HTML Tidy License\" as license name with identifier \"HTMLTIDY\". HTML Tidy is the original project, JTidy is a java fork of that. The license text is basically the same, the JTidy license misses a single \"held\", added numbers for the restrictions and changed the spelling of acknowledg(e)ment: https://editor.mergely.com/OysSHMBn/\r\n\r\nSo in my opinion, they are the same license and I think the original one should be taken.\r\n\r\n(I originally filed it for JTidy, since that came up in a license report of our product, I compared it with the existing SPDX licenses, but failed to search for the true origin)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/723583318/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/723643466","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064#issuecomment-723643466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1064","id":723643466,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMzY0MzQ2Ng==","user":{"login":"johnmhoran","id":11096678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDk2Njc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11096678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran","html_url":"https://github.com/johnmhoran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnmhoran/subscriptions","organization